; Carrack — ported verbatim from FATHOM.EXE main:models3d.js (the `carrack`
; entry). 32 vertices. Bulbous rounded "walnut" hull with towering fore and
; sterncastles; three short fat masts.
;
; AXIS CONVERSION: JS (+Z forward, left-handed) → Godot (-Z forward,
; right-handed). Every JS vertex (x, y, z) becomes (x, y, -z). JS `mastZ`
; in sailDeformations is likewise negated.

